    "slug": "adminstaffingsolutions-handle-missing-evidence-in-vendor-contact-list-without-guessing",
    "title": "Handle missing evidence in vendor contact list without guessing",
    "description": "A grounded administrative staffing note for admin staffing agency owners: vendor contact list with explicit evidence, decision rights, and a verified close.",
    "category": "evidence",
