          "Quality reviewer may prepare, compare, label, and route the admin role intake, while account manager keeps the decision that changes the destination record in the meeting notes archive. Do not let urgency expand the role; if the request affects unclear client request, the boundary stays in place even when the deadline is tight. Record the approval in the admin role intake case with the approver, the time, the scope, and the evidence reviewed. If the approver changes the scope, restart the evidence check rather than stretching the old approval."
