          "Open the admin role intake queue in the shared inbox and mark every item with the current owner, the next action, and the time it is due. At mid-day, check the admin role intake items that have no next action; those are the ones most likely to age silently. The end-of-day review should show what was completed, what is blocked, who owns the next step, and which formatted document is still missing. At the end of the day, compare the open queue with the morning list and explain every unexplained difference.",
