          "Start the evidence map by naming the field in the vendor contact list that the inbox delegation action is supposed to change. When two role intake brief versions conflict, preserve both and route the conflict to account manager; do not silently choose the cleaner-looking value. After the conflict is resolved, add a short correction entry to the inbox delegation log and link it to both source versions. Record the source identifier and the extraction time when the value comes from the vendor contact list.",
